# Agenda

1. Status of the telematics integration
2. Decision on route optimization
3. Any other business

## Item 1 – Status of the telematics integration

The adapter for the first provider has been running reliably in the staging environment for two weeks. Data quality is good; position reports are occasionally missing in tunnels, which is not a problem from a business perspective.

## Item 2 – Decision on route optimization

The group discussed building a dedicated optimization service versus extending the existing map service. Computation times for more than 500 stops have not yet been measured reliably.

{% callout type="success" title="Decision" %}
The dedicated optimization service will be built as a prototype. The final decision will be made at the next meeting, after the load test.
{% /callout %}

## Item 3 – Any other business

The staging environment will be unavailable on November 3 due to maintenance.

